abstract: >-
  DAG-orchestrated, containerised workflow for single amino-acid substitutions:
  coordinate-derived measurements, optional language-model and remote predictors,
  full provenance, and a leakage-aware evaluation layer. It does not implement
  a validated pathogenicity model.
